  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 20 - 5 × 2 + 10 ÷ 4 = 14\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the numbers:\n\nOption 1) 10 and 5\n\n20 - 5 × 2 + 10 ÷ 4 = 14 ⇒ 20 - 10 × 2 + 5 ÷ 4 = 14\n\n⇒ 20 - 10 × 2 + __**5 ÷ 4**__ = 14\n\n⇒ 20 - __**10 × 2**__ + 1.25 = 14\n\n⇒ __20 + 1.25__ - 20 = 14\n\n⇒ __21.25 - 20__ = 14\n\n⇒ 1.25 ≠ 14 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) 4 and 2\n\n20 - 5 × 2 + 10 ÷ 4 = 14 ⇒ 20 - 5 × 4 + 10 ÷ 2 = 14\n\n⇒ 20 - 5 × 4 + __**10 ÷ 2**__ = 14\n\n⇒ 20 - __**5 × 4**__ + 5 = 14\n\n⇒ __20 + 5__ - 20 = 14\n\n⇒ __25 - 20__ = 14\n\n⇒ 5 ≠ 14 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) 20 and 14\n\n20 - 5 × 2 + 10 ÷ 4 = 14 ⇒ 14 - 5 × 2 + 10 ÷ 4 = 20\n\n⇒ 14 - 5 × 2 + __**10 ÷ 4**__ = 20\n\n⇒ 14 - __**5 × 2**__ + 2.5 = 20\n\n⇒ __17 + 2.5__ - 15 = 20\n\n⇒ __19.5 - 15__ = 20\n\n⇒ 4.5 ≠ 20 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) 4 and 5\n\n20 - 5 × 2 + 10 ÷ 4 = 14 ⇒ 20 - 4 × 2 + 10 ÷ 5 = 14\n\n⇒ 20 - 4 × 2 + __**10 ÷ 5**__ = 14\n\n⇒ 20 - __**4 × 2**__ + 2 = 14\n\n⇒ __20 + 2__ - 8 = 14\n\n⇒ __22 - 8__ = 14\n\n**⇒ 14 = 14 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nHence, \"Option 4\" is the correct answer.",
